10 0 obj
<<
/Subject (ISO/IEC TR 24748-2:2011 is adopted by this standard. ISO/IEC TR 24748-2:2011 is a guide for the application of ISO/IEC 15288:2008. It addresses system, life cycle, process, organizational, project, and adaptation concepts, principally through reference to ISO/IEC TR 24748-1 and ISO/IEC 15288:2008. It then gives guidance on applying ISO/IEC 15288:2008 from the aspects of strategy, planning, application in organizations, and application on projects. ISO/IEC TR 24748-2:2011 is intentionally aligned with both ISO/IEC TR 24748-1 and ISO/IEC TR 24748-3 \(Guide to the application of ISO/IEC 12207\) in its terminology, structure and content.)
/ModDate (D:20190405162318-04'00')
/Author (Software & Systems Engineering Standards Committee of the IEEE Computer Society and ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 7)
/Title <>
/Keywords (IEEE 24748-2, life cycle, process, systems engineering)
/Producer (Acrobat Distiller 8.0.0 \(Windows\))
/CreationDate (D:20111120030206-05'00')
>>
endobj
